  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-10-11T13:05:28-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, October 11, 2023, 1:05 pm\">October 11, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>The public is invited to the Guild of Harwich Artists general meeting on October 14th at 2pm at The 204, second floor Library. Address is 204 Sisson Roads, Harwich, 02645. Well-known local watercolorist, Robert Mesrop with demonstrate his painting style.  The event is free. <a href=\"/media/archive/9f908f9e4e7255f47b186eddcdf9510c14c1ce32ee1fd4ee9cd942657cf7b623.pdf\">Demo invite</a></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
